ess was lost.\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"spawn_failed\",\"description\":\"The program could not be spawned.\",\"type\":\"string\"}]},\"FinishedRecord\":{\"description\":\"Facts about a finished program.\",\"properties\":{\"exit_code\":{\"description\":\"Exit code, when the program exited.\",\"format\":\"int32\",\"type\":[\"integer\",\"null\"]},\"final_output_offset\":{\"$ref\":\"#/components/schemas/ByteOffset\",\"description\":\"Raw output offset after the final bytes were retained.\"},\"finished_ms\":{\"$ref\":\"#/components/schemas/TimestampMs\",\"description\":\"Finish time.\"},\"reason\":{\"$ref\":\"#/components/schemas/FinishReason\",\"description\":\"Why the program finished.\",\"x-ovis-open-enum\":true},\"signal\":{\"description\":\"Signal number, when a signal ended the program.\",\"format\":\"int32\",\"type\":[\"integer\",\"null\"]}},\"required\":[\"reason\",\"finished_ms\",\"final_output_offset\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"FirstMessage\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"description\":\"First message queued under the launch and released only on declared readiness.\",\"properties\":{\"deadline_ms\":{\"anyOf\":[{\"$ref\":\"#/components/schemas/DurationMs\"},{\"type\":\"null\"}],\"description\":\"Expire the message if readiness is not declared in time; absent means 30 s.\"},\"text\":{\"description\":\"Literal text; submitted after the agent declares readiness.\",\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"text\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"FirstMessageReason\":{\"description\":\"Why a first message reached a final state other than `sent`.\",\"oneOf\":[{\"const\":\"deadline_passed\",\"description\":\"The deadline passed before the program declared readiness.\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"process_exited\",\"description\":\"The program exited before declaring readiness.\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"link_lost\",\"description\":\"The holder link ended before readiness.\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"process_replaced\",\"description\":\"Another program incarnation runs in the terminal now.\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"authority_lapsed\",\"description\":\"The requesting principal's credential lapsed before the write.\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"lease_held\",\"description\":\"An interact lease is held, so an unleased write is refused.\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"encoding_refused\",\"description\":\"The text cannot be encoded for the terminal's current modes.\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"delivery_failed\",\"description\":\"The terminal's writer refused or failed the write.\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"runtime_stopped\",\"description\":\"The runtime stopped waiting before readiness.\",\"type\":\"string\"}]},\"FirstMessageRecord\":{\"description\":\"The first message queued under one launch, readable by its requesting principal.\",\"properties\":{\"deadline_ms\":{\"$ref\":\"#/components/schemas/TimestampMs\",\"description\":\"Instant after which an unreleased message expires.\"},\"launch_op\":{\"$ref\":\"#/components/schemas/OpId\",\"description\":\"Operation that launched the terminal; the message's identity.\"},\"process_incarnation\":{\"$ref\":\"#/components/schemas/Incarnation\",\"description\":\"Program incarnation the message is bound to.\"},\"queued_seq\":{\"anyOf\":[{\"$ref\":\"#/components/schemas/EventSeq\"},{\"type\":\"null\"}],\"description\":\"Input sequence of the single submission, once sent.\"},\"reason\":{\"anyOf\":[{\"$ref\":\"#/components/schemas/FirstMessageReason\",\"x-ovis-open-enum\":true},{\"type\":\"null\"}],\"description\":\"Why the message was not sent, once cancelled or expired.\"},\"state\":{\"$ref\":\"#/components/schemas/FirstMessageState\",\"description\":\"Current state.\",\"x-ovis-open-enum\":true},\"terminal_id\":{\"$ref\":\"#/components/schemas/TerminalId\",\"description\":\"Terminal the message is bound to.\"}},\"required\":[\"launch_op\",\"terminal_id\",\"process_incarnation\",\"state\",\"deadline_ms\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"FirstMessageStat