d `graphics_terminal_store_max_bytes`.\",\"type\":\"string\"}]},\"GraphicsEvictedData\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"description\":\"Data of `graphics.evicted`: the oldest retained sequences left the terminal's store.\",\"properties\":{\"evicted_bytes\":{\"$ref\":\"#/components/schemas/ByteCount\",\"description\":\"Raw bytes evicted.\"},\"evicted_sequences\":{\"$ref\":\"#/components/schemas/Count\",\"description\":\"Sequences evicted.\"},\"limit_bytes\":{\"$ref\":\"#/components/schemas/ByteCount\",\"description\":\"The cap in force.\"},\"reason\":{\"$ref\":\"#/components/schemas/GraphicsEvictReason\",\"description\":\"Why sequences were evicted.\",\"x-ovis-open-enum\":true},\"retained_bytes\":{\"$ref\":\"#/components/schemas/ByteCount\",\"description\":\"Raw bytes still retained after the eviction.\"}},\"required\":[\"reason\",\"evicted_sequences\",\"evicted_bytes\",\"retained_bytes\",\"limit_bytes\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"GraphicsProtocol\":{\"description\":\"Graphics protocol a sequence belongs to, recognized from its introducer only.\",\"oneOf\":[{\"const\":\"kitty\",\"description\":\"Kitty graphics: `APC _G ... ST`, one transmission across its `m=1` chunks.\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"iterm2\",\"description\":\"iTerm2 inline image: `OSC 1337 ; File= ... BEL|ST`.\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"sixel\",\"description\":\"Sixel: `DCS ... q ... ST`.\",\"type\":\"string\"}]},\"GraphicsReleaseReason\":{\"description\":\"Why a retained graphics sequence is no longer held.\",\"oneOf\":[{\"const\":\"scrolled_out\",\"description\":\"The row it was placed on left the visible screen.\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"erased\",\"description\":\"The cell it was placed on was erased or overwritten, or its alternate screen\\nwas left.\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"deleted\",\"description\":\"A Kitty `a=d` command named it.\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"replaced\",\"description\":\"A Kitty transmission reused its image id.\",\"type\":\"string\"},{